      "data": {
        "type": "game",
        "name": "Toroa: Skycall",
        "steam_appid": 2003490,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1779364152\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the fate of the ocean as you glide across an ever changing seascape in the hopes of reuniting Toroa with their family on land.  <br><br>Following the winds of the Atua (Māori God) of the weather, Tāwhirimātea, Toroa will befriend creatures of the sea, meet distant relatives  while flying through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the Māori world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1779364152\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to  verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures of the sea need your help. Chat with and befriend a colourful cast from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures and gather birds into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a knowledgeable seagull, identify a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao Māori (the Māori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga pūoro (Māori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the Māori language  in character dialogue and story.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1779364152\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the fate of the ocean as you glide across an ever changing seascape in the hopes of reuniting Toroa with their family on land.  <br><br>Following the winds of the Atua (Māori God) of the weather, Tāwhirimātea, Toroa will befriend creatures of the sea, meet distant relatives  while flying through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the Māori world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1779364152\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to  verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures of the sea need your help. Chat with and befriend a colourful cast from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures and gather birds into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a knowledgeable seagull, identify a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao Māori (the Māori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga pūoro (Māori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the Māori language  in character dialogue and story.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Soar, swoop and glide across the ocean as Toroa. Fly as an albatross embarking on an epic journey back to land to reunite with their family in this relaxing, atmospheric flight game grounded in the Māori world.",
        "supported_languages": "English",
        "reviews": "“Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful game.... has a rhythm game flow state that I don't get from any other media.”<br>dotzip<br><br>“If you love slow, atmospheric, games like Abzû or Lost Ember and you're after something more about feeling than challenge, Toroa: Skycall is well worth a look.”<br>Koala Chills<br>",
